Luke's island in Last Jedi).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 01-29-2019, 03:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-29T18:32:51-08:00","id":1283611,"title":"","content":"Basically the whole Egyptian underworld is filled with strange islands. Said islands are full of snakes: good snakes, god snakes, bad snakes, really really bad snakes, and then some how you ended up inside of a snake that vomits you out into the sky. Snakes snakes snakes..... snakes. <br /> <br /> Also the good island you want to live on is also on fire. <br /> <br /> Also also it is pretty easy to get to as you just have to jump on the solar barge and take a night trip with Ra to get a over view of the whole weird cavernous river system filled with islands. Oh did I forget to mention that the solar barge is also a snake sometimes? Because it is!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2302-snakesandsuns","name":"Snakesandsuns","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2302_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"224"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-30T09:43:03-08:00","id":1283737,"title":"","content":"Hmm. Avalon might've been added to the Welsh pantheon's mythology, though it apparently originated with the 12th century &quot;History of the Kings of Britain&quot;. Likewise the sunken kingdom of Lyonesse (which I'm not sure if it was supposed to be an island or not). And maybe the sunken city of Ys in Brittany. <br /> <br /> Hawaiki is apparently the legendary origin place of the Polynesian peoples. There's apparently also a &quot;vanishing island&quot; called Kaferoor. I don't really know anything about them beyond the names. <br /> <br /> Buyan is a Russian mythic island that's the home of the Northern, Western and Eastern Winds (three brothers). <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-05T19:33:47-08:00","id":1285101,"title":"","content":"I think I remember the <a href=\"http://johnsscionresources.blogspot.com/search?q=island\" target=\"_blank\">John's Scion Resources blog</a> having a post about the various magical islands from Irish mythology, but I can't seem to find it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12300-crying","name":"Crying","ava